 "notes": [
  "Kit batch 2005+ (lane kit-batch-2005-20261121), hand-authored from the archived crops (no 2023-2025 straight-on crop was in the archive): panel 14 (S, Retiefstraat, 54.5 m) from w02-158L 2022-01-12, six house units by downpipe joints, four with two-bay loggias on storeys 2-3 over a wide storey-1 window; panel 7 (N, Tugelaweg, 52.2 m) from w01-338 2020-01-29 (42 deg oblique), white-framed window groups per storey via bayWindows and two portals; panel 15 (NE, Hertzogstraat, 50 m) from w03-65L 2018-12-11, brick-parapet balconies by house; panel 3 (SW, 12.6 m, left in the crop) and panel 0 (SW, 35.4 m) from w04-245 2019-12-19, projecting brick-parapet balcony stacks on storeys 1-3 (panel 3 bay 1, panel 0 bays 0-1 and 6-7). Courtyard walls over the deck have no crop and take otherWalls.",
  "The canopy eave (a thin pale soffit projecting about 1 m) is the kit cornice in the stone colour; the zinc dormers are 3DBAG roof volumes drawn in the wall brick with the shader window grid, not zinc.",
  "Roof: red-tile slopes from w03-65L 2018-12-11 (orange pantiles between the dormers on Hertzogstraat); the flat class stays bitumen."
 ],
